{"title":"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_22\">Problem 22</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 22\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/a/1fa99661f0d3cb72d6adde9b8d0ba27d67e1ac9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{10000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> order a merchant has a choice between three successive discounts of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />%, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />%, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% and \nthree successive discounts of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />%, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />%, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />%. By choosing the better offer, he can save: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/c/adc867dd87b66caa8199b480d6471b5acbc67c3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{nothing at all}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\$440\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\$330\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\$345\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\$360$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"550\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In order to solve this problem, we can simply try both paths and finding the positive difference between the two.\n</p><p>The first path goes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/3/6630df36beee154c0fc93a6b023495bc14749193.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10,000 * 0.8 = 8,000 * 0.8 = 6400 * 0.9 = \\textbf{5760}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"366\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>The second path goes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/e/abec772ee39060fefba98fcb8ed88921ee0b8623.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10,000 * 0.6 = 6,000 * 0.95 \\text{ or } (1 - 0.05) = 5700 * 0.95 = \\textbf{5415}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"490\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>The positive difference between the offers is therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a057da643b9ffa128341ad046ee8737137a0a649.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5760 - 5415 = \\fbox{\\textbf{(D)} \\textdollar{345}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"201\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME\" title=\"1955 AHSME\">1955 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1955 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1955\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/